author: "harness:claude-code"
estimated_minutes: 210
acceptance_criteria: "The set of commands the contract surface enumerates equals the set it can resolve by name, verified by a gate that diffs the two; Commands intentionally de-emphasised are enumerated with an explicit tier or alias marker rather than omitted, so an enumerating caller can see that they exist; An agent following the AGENTS.md quickstart can discover every command that quickstart instructs it to run, using only the documented contract discovery path; The rendered help surface and the enumerated contract surface are generated from one source so the two counts cannot diverge silently; A regression test asserts the help-versus-contract command-set difference is empty"
